201	Vegetarian Quinoa and Lentil Power Bowl	A hearty and protein-packed vegetarian power bowl featuring quinoa, lentils, and a variety of vegetables, perfect for athletes aiming to build muscle.	["muscle_gain"]	["high_protein", "muscle_gain", "meal_prep_friendly"]	["vegetarian", "high-protein"]	["lunch", "dinner", "snack", "breakfast"]	["Cook the quinoa: Rinse the quinoa thoroughly. In a pot, add 100g quinoa to 200g water and a pinch of salt. Bring to a boil, then reduce heat to a simmer. Cover and cook for about 15 minutes until water is absorbed. Fluff with a fork and set aside.", "Cook the lentils: Rinse the lentils and place in a pot with enough water to cover by about 2 inches. Bring to a boil, then reduce heat to a simmer. Cook for about 20 minutes or until tender. Drain excess water and set aside.", "In a large pan, heat 15g of olive oil over medium heat. Add minced garlic and saut\\u00e9 for 1 minute until fragrant.", "Add chopped spinach to the pan and saut\\u00e9 until wilted, about 3 minutes.", "Add diced bell pepper and halved cherry tomatoes to the pan; cook for another 5 minutes until slightly softened.", "In a large bowl, combine cooked quinoa, lentils, saut\\u00e9ed vegetables, and coat with the remaining olive oil and lemon juice. Mix well.", "Season the mixture with salt and black pepper to taste.", "Top the bowl with grated parmesan cheese and toasted pumpkin seeds before serving."]	continental	45	0	medium	1	{"calories": 710.0, "protein_g": 55.0, "carbs_g": 78.0, "fat_g": 22.0, "fiber_g": 15.0}	\N	\N	[-0.01015427801758051, -0.05459466204047203, 0.0021553614642471075, 0.006665763910859823, -0.034015949815511703, -0.022692961618304253, -0.019956180825829506, 0.04348309710621834, 0.011005851440131664, -0.00735876802355051, 0.04726525768637657, 0.011387591250240803, 0.025089113041758537, 0.029857922345399857, -0.00112980289850384, 0.0394895114004612, 0.002482776762917638, 0.013660411350429058, -0.012239164672791958, 0.07493845373392105, 0.046701457351