202	Teriyaki Salmon with Stir-Fried Vegetables and Brown Rice	A high-protein, Asian-inspired dish perfect for muscle gain, featuring teriyaki-glazed salmon served with a side of stir-fried vegetables and brown rice.	["muscle_gain"]	["muscle_gain", "meal_prep_friendly", "high_protein"]	["high-protein"]	["lunch", "dinner", "snack", "breakfast"]	["Cook the brown rice according to package instructions (use approximately 555g of water for 185g of rice). This will take about 30-35 minutes.", "While the rice is cooking, prepare the teriyaki sauce by combining soy sauce, brown sugar, minced garlic, and minced ginger in a small bowl.", "Heat 13.5g (1 tbsp) of olive oil in a pan over medium heat. Add the salmon fillets and cook for about 4 minutes on each side until fully cooked. Brush the teriyaki sauce on the salmon while cooking to glaze it.", "In another pan, heat the remaining olive oil (13.5g) over medium heat. Add the broccoli, carrot, and bell pepper, and stir-fry for about 5-7 minutes until the vegetables are tender yet crisp.", "Serve the cooked brown rice in bowls, top with a salmon fillet, and arrange the stir-fried vegetables on the side. Garnish with sliced green onions before serving."]	asian	45	0	medium	2	{"calories": 720.0, "protein_g": 57.0, "carbs_g": 84.0, "fat_g": 19.0, "fiber_g": 8.0}	\N	\N	[-0.048123594373464584, -0.03584440425038338, -0.023723216727375984, -0.00834601279348135, 0.02010040357708931, -0.019152376800775528, -0.02269618771970272, 0.018305925652384758, 0.025348402559757233, -0.026747869327664375, 0.03365491330623627, -0.06419488787651062, 0.04704013466835022, -0.006653109565377235, -0.025370975956320763, -0.011602029204368591, 0.01152867078781128, -0.00725126825273037, 0.00021055483375675976, 0.008120291866362095, -0.006839328911155462, -0.04573095589876175, 0.03807903453707695, 0.0426611602306366, 0.008007431402802467, 0.019942399114370346, -0.006461246870458126, 0.06907045096158981, -0.013791517354547977, -0.0015546494396403432, 0.0334517