203	Mexican Quinoa and Black Bean Bowl	A high-protein, vegetarian Mexican-inspired bowl perfect for muscle gain, featuring quinoa, black beans, and vibrant vegetables, all seasoned with traditional Mexican spices.	["muscle_gain"]	["meal_prep_friendly", "high_protein", "mexican_flavor"]	["vegetarian", "high-protein"]	["lunch", "dinner", "snack", "breakfast"]	["Cook the quinoa according to package instructions until light and fluffy. Use 370g of water to cook 185g of quinoa and let it absorb completely.", "In a pan, heat 13.5g (1 tbsp) of olive oil over medium heat. Add chopped red onion and minced garlic and saut\\u00e9 until soft.", "Add chopped red bell pepper and cooked sweet corn to the pan and cook for about 5 minutes until the vegetables are tender.", "In a large bowl, combine the cooked quinoa, black beans, and saut\\u00e9ed vegetables. Mix well.", "In a small bowl, prepare the dressing by mixing lime juice, the remaining olive oil, cumin, chipotle powder, salt, and black pepper.", "Pour the dressing over the quinoa mixture and toss to combine evenly.", "Top the quinoa bowl with sliced avocado and garnish with chopped cilantro."]	mexican	45	0	easy	2	{"calories": 728.0, "protein_g": 57.0, "carbs_g": 81.0, "fat_g": 20.0, "fiber_g": 18.0}	\N	\N	[-0.02790646068751812, -0.023130293935537338, 0.010433650575578213, -0.00018194921722169966, -0.028816206380724907, -0.0390281081199646, 0.023471448570489883, 0.05899703502655029, -0.03202306106686592, 0.003792504081502557, 0.0032750859390944242, -0.01221334096044302, 0.0014826018596068025, 0.027747254818677902, -0.009751340374350548, 0.02776999957859516, -0.0008912668563425541, -0.02583678811788559, -0.017978856340050697, 0.05654072016477585, 0.031181547790765762, 0.02642812393605709, -0.022607190534472466, 0.061589810997247696, 0.03372883424162865, 0.0223342664539814, -0.009808199480175972, 0.02440393902361393, -0.0019204170675948262, 0.0029481458477675915, 0.008324177004396915, -0.041529908776283264, -0.0236306544393301