192	High-Protein Indian Chicken Curry with Brown Rice	A delicious and protein-packed Indian chicken curry served with brown rice, perfect for muscle gain and packed with flavors.	["muscle_gain"]	["muscle_gain", "high_protein", "indian", "meal_prep_friendly"]	["high-protein"]	["lunch", "dinner", "snack", "breakfast"]	["Rinse the brown rice thoroughly and soak in water for 20 minutes.", "Boil 480 grams of water in a pot. Add the soaked rice, reduce heat, cover, and let it simmer for 25-30 minutes or until rice is cooked and water is absorbed.", "Heat 14 grams of olive oil (about 1 tablespoon) in a pan over medium heat.", "Add chopped onions and saut\\u00e9 until golden brown.", "Add minced garlic and ginger, and saut\\u00e9 for another 2 minutes until fragrant.", "Add chicken cubes to the pan and cook until they are white on the outside.", "Mix in tomato puree, yogurt, coriander powder, cumin powder, turmeric powder, red chili powder, and salt. Stir well to combine.", "Cover and cook on low heat for 15-20 minutes until the chicken is fully cooked and tender, stirring occasionally.", "In a separate pan, heat the remaining olive oil and lightly toast the spices for garnishing, if desired.", "Serve the chicken curry hot over cooked brown rice, garnishing with fresh coriander leaves if desired."]	indian	50	0	medium	2	{"calories": 900.0, "protein_g": 68.0, "carbs_g": 101.0, "fat_g": 25.0, "fiber_g": 7.0}	\N	\N	[-0.02869229018688202, -0.02244604378938675, -0.0015545401256531477, 0.021468663588166237, -0.03590468317270279, -0.02972584031522274, 0.06704603880643845, 0.012896926142275333, 0.00754941999912262, -0.012593600898981094, 0.03714045137166977, -0.061114352196455, 0.04947566241025925, 0.009846825152635574, 0.012593600898981094, 0.02532201260328293, 0.018974658101797104, 0.05122820660471916, -0.050014905631542206, 0.01441355049610138, 0.05518266558647156, -0.012537430040538311, 0.004752090200781822, 0.022749368101358414, -0.008245944045484066, -0.004580767825245857, 0.0