206	Grilled Chicken with Herbed Quinoa and Roasted Vegetables	A high-protein, continental dish perfect for muscle gain, featuring grilled chicken breast, herbed quinoa, and a side of roasted vegetables.	["muscle_gain"]	["muscle_gain", "high_protein", "meal_prep_friendly"]	["high-protein"]	["lunch", "dinner", "snack", "breakfast"]	["Preheat your oven to 200\\u00b0C (392\\u00b0F).", "Toss the sliced bell pepper, zucchini, and carrot with 5g of olive oil, salt, and black pepper. Place them on a baking sheet and roast in the oven for 25-30 minutes, turning halfway through.", "Rinse and cook the quinoa according to package instructions. Once cooked, fluff with a fork and stir in chopped parsley, lemon juice, and minced garlic.", "Heat a grill pan over medium-high heat. Brush the chicken breast with the remaining olive oil, season with salt and black pepper, and grill for 6-8 minutes on each side until fully cooked.", "Plate the grilled chicken with herbed quinoa and roasted vegetables. Serve warm."]	continental	45	0	medium	1	{"calories": 780.0, "protein_g": 58.5, "carbs_g": 87.75, "fat_g": 21.5, "fiber_g": 12.5}	\N	\N	[0.016544511541724205, -0.04491489380598068, 0.024447940289974213, 0.011328248307108879, -0.025267554447054863, 0.002469089813530445, 0.010649139061570168, 0.00913870520889759, -0.004118564538657665, 0.003123318077996373, 0.025759324431419373, -0.03639090061187744, 0.03746810555458069, 0.034166231751441956, -0.026461850851774216, 0.07240711897611618, -0.03198839724063873, 0.030161825940012932, -0.012083464302122593, 0.022410612553358078, 0.05999580770730972, -0.0018938956782221794, 0.01449547428637743, 0.009706581942737103, -0.020642586052417755, 0.01300845853984356, 0.010391545481979847, 0.018230576068162918, -0.008822568692266941, 0.006638880353420973, 0.04945790022611618, -0.029037782922387123, 0.028780190274119377, -0.017469504848122597, -0.000785952084697783, -0.06449197977781296, -0.0039019521791487932, 0.01784418523311615, 0.018652092665433884, 0.018