204	Mediterranean Grilled Chicken Bowl with Brown Rice and Vegetables	A high-protein Mediterranean-inspired dish perfect for muscle gain, featuring grilled chicken breast, brown rice, and roasted vegetables.	["muscle_gain"]	["muscle_gain", "high_protein", "meal_prep_friendly"]	["high-protein"]	["lunch", "dinner", "snack", "breakfast"]	["Cook the brown rice according to package instructions. This should yield about 555g of cooked rice.", "In a large bowl, combine sliced chicken breast, 15g olive oil, lemon juice, minced garlic, oregano, salt, and black pepper. Marinate for at least 15 minutes.", "Preheat the grill to medium-high heat.", "Grill the chicken slices for about 6-7 minutes on each side or until fully cooked and slightly charred. Remove from grill and let it rest.", "Meanwhile, toss the sliced bell pepper, zucchini, and red onion with the remaining olive oil, salt, and pepper.", "Grill the vegetables for about 8-10 minutes until they are tender and slightly charred.", "Divide the cooked rice between two bowls, top with grilled chicken slices and grilled vegetables.", "Serve immediately, optionally garnished with fresh herbs."]	mediterranean	45	0	medium	2	{"calories": 765.0, "protein_g": 58.0, "carbs_g": 85.0, "fat_g": 22.0, "fiber_g": 8.0}	\N	\N	[-0.03863478824496269, -0.028643032535910606, 0.02453889325261116, 0.01540664304047823, -0.016706645488739014, -0.04059016332030296, 0.06605302542448044, 0.03175874054431915, 0.0032070314045995474, 0.00833720713853836, -0.0005791592411696911, -0.04404967650771141, 0.03511081635951996, 0.04061165079474449, 0.0065591041930019855, 0.05041002109646797, -6.253241008380428e-05, 0.026838071644306183, -0.013923995196819305, 0.03766784444451332, 0.08921670913696289, 0.03102816268801689, -0.0006211273139342666, 0.008971092291176319, -0.024001700803637505, 0.023357072845101357, 0.011076881550252438, 0.005871499422937632, 0.002704757498577237, -0.020961198955774307, 0.028750471770763397, -0.025312447920441628, 0.034509159624576