205	High-Protein Paneer and Lentil Curry	A hearty and protein-packed Indian dish combining paneer and lentils with rich spices, perfect for muscle gain.	["muscle_gain"]	["muscle_gain", "high_protein", "indian", "meal_prep_friendly"]	["high-protein", "vegetarian"]	["lunch", "dinner", "snack", "breakfast"]	["Heat olive oil in a large pan over medium heat. Add the cumin seeds and let them sizzle for 30 seconds.", "Add chopped onions, ginger, and garlic to the pan. Saut\\u00e9 until the onions are golden brown.", "Stir in the turmeric powder, coriander powder, and garam masala. Cook for another minute to release the flavors.", "Add the chopped tomatoes and green peppers, cooking until the tomatoes become soft.", "Mix in the rinsed red lentils and 400g of water. Cover and simmer for about 20 minutes, or until the lentils are tender and the water is mostly absorbed.", "Stir in the cubed paneer and salt, cooking for another 5 minutes until the paneer is heated through.", "Adjust the consistency with remaining water if needed. Garnish with chopped cilantro and serve hot."]	indian	50	0	medium	1	{"calories": 765.0, "protein_g": 57.0, "carbs_g": 86.0, "fat_g": 21.0, "fiber_g": 18.0}	\N	\N	[-0.021298959851264954, -0.04519622400403023, -0.003043772652745247, 0.008414697833359241, -0.0422641895711422, 0.001050347345881164, -0.015387216582894325, 0.02415947988629341, 0.04610205814242363, -0.02996395342051983, 0.04312234744429588, -0.05249055102467537, 0.05396848917007446, 0.03067908249795437, 0.03668617457151413, -0.004329517018049955, 0.04398050531744957, 0.024433612823486328, -0.03582802042365074, 0.06059535965323448, 0.05978488177061081, -0.0071930172853171825, 0.021847225725650787, 0.039451345801353455, -0.014457548037171364, 0.0142668467015028, 0.019880617037415504, -0.018688734620809555, 0.028509855270385742, -0.04862884804606438, -0.004618548788130283, -0.014362197369337082, -0.0030422827694565058, -0.0678420141339302, -0.017866333946585655, -0.061739567667245865, -0.009189