193	High-Protein Asian Teriyaki Chicken with Brown Rice and Vegetables	A delicious and hearty Asian-inspired dish perfect for muscle gain, featuring teriyaki-marinated chicken, nutritious brown rice, and a colorful medley of vegetables.	["muscle_gain"]	["muscle_gain", "high_protein", "asian", "meal_prep_friendly"]	["high-protein"]	["lunch", "dinner", "snack", "breakfast"]	["Cook the brown rice according to package instructions in a rice cooker or pot. This should take about 20 minutes.", "While the rice is cooking, prepare the teriyaki sauce by mixing soy sauce, honey, sesame oil, ginger, and garlic in a bowl.", "Slice the chicken breasts and marinate them in half of the teriyaki sauce for 15 minutes.", "Heat olive oil in a large pan over medium heat. Add the marinated chicken and cook until fully cooked and lightly browned, about 8 minutes.", "Remove the chicken from the pan and set aside. In the same pan, add broccoli, carrot, and red bell pepper and stir-fry for about 5 minutes until slightly tender.", "Return the chicken to the pan and add the remaining teriyaki sauce. Stir everything together and cook for an additional 2-3 minutes to heat through.", "Serve the teriyaki chicken and vegetables over the cooked brown rice, garnished with chopped green onion."]	asian	45	0	medium	2	{"calories": 950.0, "protein_g": 78.0, "carbs_g": 110.0, "fat_g": 30.0, "fiber_g": 8.0}	\N	\N	[-0.05441485717892647, -0.037314966320991516, -0.03870446979999542, 0.013726976700127125, 0.014343289658427238, -0.03000885248184204, 0.022512242197990417, 0.06409657746553421, -0.0036278439220041037, -0.011676334775984287, 0.026042034849524498, -0.03913028910756111, 0.022332949563860893, 0.004807243123650551, -0.039825040847063065, -0.02052883431315422, 0.013099458068609238, 0.04177483171224594, -0.02931409887969494, -0.015800030902028084, 0.02022627927362919, -0.00750221312046051, 0.024943877011537552, 0.04269369691610336, -0.017895495519042015, 0.029291687533259392, 0.04036291316151619, 0.00118