194	Mediterranean Grilled Lamb with Couscous and Vegetables	A robust, protein-rich Mediterranean dish featuring grilled lamb accompanied by a bed of zesty couscous and roasted vegetables. Perfect for muscle gain.	["muscle_gain"]	["high_protein", "muscle_gain", "mediterranean", "grilled"]	["high-protein"]	["lunch", "dinner", "snack", "breakfast"]	["Preheat grill to medium-high heat.", "In a bowl, marinade the cubed lamb with 10g of olive oil, minced garlic, lemon juice, salt, and black pepper. Let it rest for 15 minutes.", "Cook the couscous according to package instructions, then fluff with a fork once done.", "Toss cherry tomatoes, zucchini, and bell pepper with remaining olive oil, salt, and black pepper.", "Grill the vegetables until slightly charred, about 10 minutes, turning once.", "Grill the lamb skewers for about 5-7 minutes on each side until cooked to your desired doneness.", "Serve the grilled lamb over a bed of couscous, topped with grilled vegetables and garnish with chopped parsley."]	mediterranean	45	0	medium	1	{"calories": 630.0, "protein_g": 47.0, "carbs_g": 68.0, "fat_g": 20.0, "fiber_g": 9.0}	\N	\N	[-0.03237222135066986, -0.08426560461521149, 0.02650253288447857, -0.020666195079684258, -0.03210541978478432, 0.018820801749825478, -0.004610707052052021, 0.018320543691515923, 0.005958623252809048, -0.022333720698952675, -0.009377050213515759, -0.0587858222424984, 0.039509229362010956, 0.024123530834913254, -0.003460114821791649, 0.03530706465244293, -0.008648897521197796, 0.03528483211994171, -0.015852605924010277, 0.05256039276719093, 0.058474548161029816, 0.003860320895910263, -0.001151287229731679, 0.03255009278655052, -0.020243756473064423, 0.021644476801156998, 0.021422140300273895, 0.020343806594610214, 0.016575200483202934, -0.012139583006501198, 0.03904232382774353, -0.006292128469794989, 0.0035156989470124245, -0.06501124799251556, -0.023034080862998962, -0.03784170374274254, 0.008309833705425262, 0.024501502513885498, 0.045245517045259476, 