195	Paneer Tikka with Quinoa Pilaf	A high-protein Indian dish featuring spiced paneer cubes grilled to perfection, served with a flavorful quinoa pilaf.	["muscle_gain"]	["grilled", "high_protein", "meal_prep_friendly"]	["high-protein", "vegetarian"]	["lunch", "dinner", "snack", "breakfast"]	["In a bowl, mix yogurt, turmeric powder, coriander powder, garam masala, lemon juice, minced garlic, grated ginger, and salt.", "Add paneer cubes and bell pepper to the marinade, coat well, and let it sit for 20 minutes.", "Heat 7g of olive oil in a pan over medium heat, add cumin seeds, and let them splutter.", "Add sliced onions and saut\\u00e9 until golden brown.", "Add rinsed quinoa and water, bring to a boil, then lower heat and cover. Cook until quinoa absorbs all the water, about 15 minutes.", "Meanwhile, heat a grill pan with the remaining olive oil over medium heat.", "Skewer the marinated paneer and bell pepper, and grill each side for about 3-4 minutes until nicely charred.", "Serve the grilled paneer tikka hot alongside the quinoa pilaf."]	indian	50	0	medium	1	{"calories": 615.0, "protein_g": 46.0, "carbs_g": 70.0, "fat_g": 17.0, "fiber_g": 9.0}	\N	\N	[-0.003939088433980942, -0.03297034278512001, -0.02247767522931099, 0.0012327727163210511, -0.023588256910443306, 0.011071094311773777, 0.012181674130260944, 0.006206522695720196, -0.000744001823477447, 0.005752457305788994, 0.03671855106949806, -0.03021703101694584, -0.00015527151117566973, 0.023495707660913467, 0.012170105241239071, 0.01992102898657322, 0.003155319718644023, -0.013003041036427021, -0.014333423227071762, 0.05215098336338997, 0.03734325245022774, 0.00022829794033896178, -0.0010599675588309765, 0.05127177760004997, 0.02164474129676819, 0.001905917190015316, 0.020638277754187584, -0.008821012452244759, 0.030078208073973656, -0.024918638169765472, 0.03021703101694584, -0.013188137672841549, 0.018393980339169502, -0.05613056197762489, -0.02021024189889431, -0.04377536103129387, -0.02570529840886593, -0.0141