196	Grilled Chicken with Mushroom Rice Pilaf	A high-protein continental dish featuring juicy grilled chicken breast with a flavorful mushroom rice pilaf, perfect for muscle gain.	["muscle_gain"]	["high_protein", "meal_prep_friendly", "muscle_gain"]	["high-protein"]	["lunch", "dinner", "snack", "breakfast"]	["Preheat a grill pan over medium-high heat. Season the chicken breast with salt and black pepper.", "Brush the grill pan with 13.5 grams of olive oil. Grill the chicken breast for about 6-7 minutes on each side, or until fully cooked and grill marks appear. Remove from heat and let rest.", "Meanwhile, heat the remaining 13.5 grams of olive oil in a large saucepan over medium heat. Add the diced onion and cook until translucent, about 5 minutes.", "Add the sliced mushrooms to the saucepan and saut\\u00e9 until they release their moisture and start to brown, about 5 minutes.", "Stir in the uncooked brown rice and cook for 1-2 minutes to toast the rice lightly.", "Pour in the chicken broth, adding salt and pepper to taste. Bring to a boil, then reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for about 20-25 minutes, or until the rice is tender and the liquid is absorbed.", "Fluff the rice with a fork and stir in the chopped parsley.", "Slice the grilled chicken and serve it over the mushroom rice pilaf."]	continental	45	0	medium	2	{"calories": 626.0, "protein_g": 48.0, "carbs_g": 71.0, "fat_g": 17.0, "fiber_g": 5.0}	\N	\N	[0.007127308752387762, -0.03845600411295891, 0.03327690809965134, 0.0013961174990981817, -0.002022328320890665, -0.04852377995848656, 0.06335923075675964, 0.04496617615222931, 0.00839788094162941, -0.010346093215048313, 0.0325508676469326, -0.031171387061476707, 0.02860604040324688, 0.026766734197735786, -0.04569222033023834, 0.049951665103435516, -0.039278849959373474, 0.03889162838459015, -0.00454078521579504, 0.019542619585990906, 0.03976288065314293, -0.018453557044267654, 0.00126300984993577, -0.007556883152574301, -0.02141822688281536, 0.0161302238