197	Vegetarian Tofu Stir-Fry with Brown Rice	A high-protein Asian-inspired vegetarian stir-fry perfect for muscle gain goals.	["muscle_gain"]	["muscle_gain", "meal_prep_friendly", "quick"]	["high-protein", "vegetarian"]	["lunch", "dinner", "snack", "breakfast"]	["Cook the brown rice: Bring 555ml of water to a boil, add the rice, cover, and simmer for 35-40 minutes until tender.", "While the rice cooks, heat 15g of sesame oil in a large pan over medium heat.", "Add the cubed tofu and cook until golden on all sides, about 8 minutes. Remove and set aside.", "In the same pan, add the remaining 12g of sesame oil, minced garlic, and ginger. Saut\\u00e9 for 1 minute.", "Add the chopped broccoli and sliced red bell pepper to the pan, stir-frying for 5-7 minutes until tender-crisp.", "Return the tofu to the pan, add soy sauce and stir to coat evenly. Cook for an additional 2-3 minutes.", "Remove from heat. Serve the stir-fry over cooked brown rice, garnished with sliced green onions and sesame seeds."]	asian	40	0	easy	2	{"calories": 630.0, "protein_g": 46.5, "carbs_g": 70.2, "fat_g": 18.5, "fiber_g": 10.0}	\N	\N	[-0.06006772816181183, -0.033820655196905136, -0.011460553854703903, -0.011961451731622219, -0.038388848304748535, -0.04053269326686859, -0.02458409033715725, 0.05602046847343445, 0.0032909021247178316, -0.018903903663158417, 0.006967495661228895, -0.02770969644188881, 0.03478237986564636, -0.002952795708552003, -0.013614417053759098, -0.0518529936671257, 0.007633690722286701, -0.003997168503701687, -0.041434310376644135, 0.005665160249918699, 0.006737082730978727, -0.04299711436033249, 0.041594598442316055, 0.06351390480995178, -0.0104787927120924, 0.008685576729476452, 0.0409734845161438, 0.03482245281338692, 0.0044479770585894585, -0.03023422323167324, -0.015597973950207233, -0.013343931175768375, -0.0068973698653280735, -0.012392224743962288, -0.0023805194068700075, -0.0398113988339901, 0.010068056173622608, -0.014916752465069294, 0.019955789670348167, -0.0121417