198	Mexican Chicken Burrito Bowl	A high-protein Mexican-inspired burrito bowl perfect for muscle gain, combining chicken, brown rice, and black beans with authentic spices.	["muscle_gain"]	["muscle_gain", "meal_prep_friendly"]	["high-protein"]	["lunch", "dinner", "snack", "breakfast"]	["Cook the brown rice according to package instructions until tender. Set aside.", "Heat a grill pan over medium heat and brush with olive oil.", "Season the chicken breast with cumin, chili powder, salt, and black pepper.", "Grill the chicken breast for 6-7 minutes on each side or until fully cooked. Let it rest for 5 minutes, then slice.", "In a separate pan, saut\\u00e9 the sliced bell pepper in a little olive oil until soft.", "Drain and rinse the black beans, then heat them in a small saucepan.", "Assemble the bowl by placing cooked brown rice at the bottom, followed by grilled chicken slices, saut\\u00e9ed bell peppers, and black beans.", "Top with sliced avocado, chopped cilantro, and a drizzle of lime juice.", "Serve immediately and enjoy!"]	mexican	45	0	medium	1	{"calories": 670.0, "protein_g": 51.0, "carbs_g": 75.0, "fat_g": 18.0, "fiber_g": 15.0}	\N	\N	[-0.03832845017313957, -0.018697090446949005, -0.008174867369234562, 0.0350351482629776, -0.0213597621768713, -0.07422780245542526, 0.06983672827482224, 0.06778132915496826, -0.01195866335183382, 0.021873610094189644, -0.006668356247246265, 0.013301678001880646, 0.006230417173355818, 0.0238589346408844, -0.008554414846003056, 0.05498182401061058, 0.010422956198453903, -0.010317850857973099, -0.034054163843393326, 0.032652758061885834, 0.019958356395363808, 0.024968381971120834, -0.023543618619441986, 0.01451622974127531, 0.007707732263952494, 0.034264374524354935, -0.007112134713679552, 0.005372055806219578, -0.021803539246320724, -0.039519645273685455, -0.007047903724014759, -0.036156270653009415, 0.007830355316400528, -0.019853251054883003, -0.016396449878811836, -0.04313994571566582, 0.0003227978013455868, 0.020448848605155