199	Mediterranean Chickpea and Quinoa Bowl	A high-protein Mediterranean-inspired bowl featuring seasoned chickpeas and quinoa, perfect for muscle gain.	["muscle_gain"]	["muscle_gain", "high_protein", "meal_prep_friendly"]	["vegetarian", "high-protein"]	["lunch", "dinner", "snack", "breakfast"]	["Rinse and cook quinoa according to package instructions with a pinch of salt. Once cooked, set aside and allow to cool slightly.", "In a pan, heat olive oil over medium heat. Add minced garlic and saut\\u00e9 for 1 minute until fragrant.", "Add cooked chickpeas to the pan, along with cumin, salt, and black pepper. Stir well and cook for 5 minutes until chickpeas are heated through and slightly crisp.", "In a large bowl, combine cooked quinoa, chickpeas, raw spinach, and diced red bell pepper.", "Drizzle with lemon juice and toss everything together gently.", "Top with crumbled feta cheese before serving.", "Serve immediately or refrigerate for up to 2 days. Enjoy!"]	mediterranean	40	0	easy	1	{"calories": 665.0, "protein_g": 48.0, "carbs_g": 78.0, "fat_g": 19.0, "fiber_g": 16.0}	\N	\N	[-0.03455999493598938, -0.037755612283945084, 0.02954169549047947, 0.009622354991734028, -0.02738761343061924, 0.012569422833621502, 0.02138695679605007, 0.017339175567030907, -0.00033102737506851554, -0.003967890050262213, 0.01978914812207222, -0.023174135014414787, 0.012451067566871643, 0.03600393980741501, -0.008030464872717857, 0.03283199667930603, -0.015611176379024982, -0.015066738240420818, -0.01422640960663557, 0.05278684198856354, 0.07418563216924667, 0.018510902300477028, -0.020842518657445908, 0.037755612283945084, 0.008639998733997345, 0.014190902933478355, 0.0013366847997531295, 0.018297860398888588, 0.03766092658042908, -0.02681950479745865, 0.03683243319392204, -0.0203927643597126, 0.0016155614284798503, -0.02551758661866188, -0.031056653708219528, -0.04881007596850395, -0.005231341812759638, 0.019410409033298492, -0.027790024876594543, -0.004263780545443296, -0.01615561544895172,