200	High-Protein Chicken Tikka with Brown Rice	A flavorful Indian-inspired chicken tikka served with nutritious brown rice, perfect for muscle gain.	["muscle_gain"]	["muscle_gain", "indian", "grilled"]	["high-protein"]	["lunch", "dinner", "snack", "breakfast"]	["In a bowl, combine yogurt, garlic, ginger, lemon juice, cumin powder, coriander powder, turmeric powder, paprika, and salt to prepare the marinade.", "Add diced chicken breast to the marinade and mix until well coated. Let it marinate for at least 30 minutes in the refrigerator.", "Cook brown rice according to package instructions or until tender. Set aside.", "Preheat grill or stovetop grill pan over medium-high heat. Drizzle olive oil to prevent sticking.", "Place marinated chicken on the grill, cooking each side for about 6-8 minutes, or until fully cooked and slightly charred.", "Serve chicken tikka over cooked brown rice. Garnish with sliced cucumber and chopped mint leaves."]	indian	60	0	medium	2	{"calories": 690.0, "protein_g": 52.0, "carbs_g": 78.0, "fat_g": 19.0, "fiber_g": 6.0}	\N	\N	[-0.034197039902210236, -0.03312348946928978, -0.021784117445349693, 0.014123891480267048, -0.024915305897593498, 0.0006587375537492335, 0.053901154547929764, 0.00394753273576498, 0.010042165406048298, -0.002039465354755521, 0.024579821154475212, -0.06369730085134506, 0.02464691735804081, -0.011507113464176655, -0.016080884262919426, 0.03515876084566116, 0.011674855835735798, 0.02674928680062294, -0.047102004289627075, 0.007425387389957905, 0.04052651301026344, 0.010254639200866222, 0.022812936455011368, 0.0301712267100811, -0.0036400053650140762, 0.0148731404915452, 0.013598299585282803, -0.05358803644776344, 0.02224261313676834, -0.050948891788721085, 0.0187759418040514, -0.004861727356910706, 0.005353771150112152, -0.043993182480335236, 0.00068669457687065, -0.05287233740091324, 0.010025391355156898, 0.005443233996629715, 0.031938113272190094, -0.004341726657003164, -0.001339141745120287, -0.011434425599873066, 0.00