207	High-Protein Tofu Stir-Fry with Black Rice	A protein-packed vegetarian Asian recipe featuring tofu and black rice, ideal for muscle gain.	["muscle_gain"]	["muscle_gain", "stir_fry", "protein_rich", "asian_flavor"]	["high-protein", "vegetarian"]	["lunch", "dinner", "snack", "breakfast"]	["Cook the black rice by adding it to a pot with 300ml of water. Bring to a boil, then reduce heat to simmer, cover and cook for 30-40 minutes until tender and water is absorbed.", "While the rice is cooking, heat a large pan over medium-high heat and add sesame oil.", "Add diced tofu to the pan and stir-fry until golden brown on all sides, about 8 minutes. Remove tofu from pan and set aside.", "In the same pan, add minced garlic, ginger, and sliced carrots. Stir-fry for 3 minutes.", "Add chopped broccoli and continue to stir-fry for another 3 minutes until vegetables are tender-crisp.", "Return the tofu to the pan and add soy sauce. Stir to combine and let everything warm through, about 2 minutes.", "Serve the tofu stir-fry over the cooked black rice. Garnish with chopped scallions and toasted sesame seeds."]	asian	50	0	medium	1	{"calories": 810.0, "protein_g": 61.0, "carbs_g": 88.0, "fat_g": 25.0, "fiber_g": 12.0}	\N	\N	[-0.049332648515701294, -0.04284266382455826, -0.008951134979724884, -0.007926112040877342, -0.0037136520259082317, -0.054857902228832245, -0.060207754373550415, 0.05827829986810684, -0.005566366948187351, -0.023767372593283653, 0.025894157588481903, -0.026201117783784866, 0.032932281494140625, 0.008320773020386696, -0.029073374345898628, -0.059944648295640945, -0.019261658191680908, 0.0025817418936640024, -0.026902737095952034, 0.007860335521399975, -0.014865570701658726, -0.03238414227962494, 0.04849947243928909, 0.06871489435434341, -0.011034068651497364, 0.02302190288901329, 0.026025712490081787, 0.024096257984638214, 0.01177405845373869, 0.0028640341479331255, -0.044750191271305084, -0.019820760935544968, -0.034795962274074554, -0.01410913746803999, -0.03703