209	Mediterranean Protein-Packed Chickpea and Quinoa Salad	A high-protein, vegetarian Mediterranean salad perfect for muscle gain, featuring chickpeas, quinoa, and feta cheese, enhanced with fresh vegetables and herbs.	["muscle_gain"]	["high_protein", "vegetarian", "muscle_gain", "meal_prep_friendly"]	["vegetarian", "high-protein"]	["lunch", "dinner", "snack", "breakfast"]	["Cook the quinoa by boiling 80g of dry quinoa in water until it absorbs the water and triples in size. This will yield approximately 250g of cooked quinoa.", "Rinse and drain the canned chickpeas to remove excess sodium. Add them to a large mixing bowl.", "Dice the cucumber, halve the cherry tomatoes, and dice the red onion, then add them to the mixing bowl with chickpeas.", "Add the crumbled feta cheese to the mixture.", "In a separate small bowl, whisk together the olive oil and lemon juice to create a dressing. Season with salt and black pepper to taste.", "Pour the dressing over the salad ingredients and toss gently to combine.", "Chop the fresh parsley and sprinkle over the salad for added flavor.", "Serve immediately or refrigerate for up to 24 hours for flavors to meld."]	mediterranean	30	0	easy	1	{"calories": 820.0, "protein_g": 62.0, "carbs_g": 94.0, "fat_g": 23.0, "fiber_g": 17.0}	\N	\N	[-0.006590454373508692, -0.055615078657865524, 0.008702562190592289, 0.003543710568919778, -0.022770104929804802, -0.005698173772543669, 0.024735381826758385, 0.00975296925753355, -0.024690203368663788, -0.009865916334092617, 0.04167742282152176, -0.015914225950837135, 0.01658061146736145, 0.014558861963450909, 0.004125387407839298, 0.025458242744207382, -0.026339229196310043, -0.007550503592938185, -0.027875307947397232, 0.043326448649168015, 0.057828839868307114, 0.014073190279304981, -0.011356815695762634, 0.022578096017241478, 0.0029733283445239067, 0.034268103539943695, 0.004579999018460512, -0.012525816448032856, 0.00012733004405163229, -0.02927584946155548, 0.02376403845846653, -0.0218100566416978