210	Indian Spiced Paneer and Chickpea Bowl	A high-protein Indian-style dish featuring spiced paneer and chickpeas, served with fragrant basmati rice and a side of sautéed spinach, perfect for muscle gain.	["muscle_gain"]	["high_protein", "muscle_gain", "indian"]	["vegetarian", "high-protein"]	["lunch", "dinner", "snack", "breakfast"]	["Cook the brown rice by adding it to a pot with 185g of water. Bring to a boil, then reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 20 minutes until water is absorbed and rice is tender.", "Heat 6g of olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat. Add cumin seeds and let them sizzle for a few seconds.", "Add chopped onion, garlic, and ginger. Saut\\u00e9 for about 5 minutes until the onion is translucent.", "Stir in turmeric, coriander, and red chili powder. Cook for 1 minute.", "Add tomato paste, paneer cubes, and cooked chickpeas. Stir well to coat everything with the spices. Cook for 10-12 minutes, stirring occasionally.", "In another pan, heat the remaining olive oil. Add spinach and saut\\u00e9 until wilted, about 3 minutes.", "Once everything is cooked, layer the rice at the bottom of a bowl. Top with the paneer and chickpea mixture, and place saut\\u00e9ed spinach on the side.", "Serve hot, garnished with chopped coriander if desired."]	indian	45	0	medium	1	{"calories": 802.0, "protein_g": 67.0, "carbs_g": 90.0, "fat_g": 24.0, "fiber_g": 15.0}	\N	\N	[-0.04032960161566734, -0.02676481194794178, -0.009934213943779469, -0.010270483791828156, -0.03358140215277672, -0.014738884754478931, 0.05626538023352623, -0.0001199564867420122, 0.02295755222439766, 0.011165304109454155, 0.051751382648944855, -0.0295917596668005, 0.029728546738624573, 0.02113371342420578, 0.031278807669878006, -0.007363743148744106, 0.039166904985904694, 0.006879286374896765, -0.018603140488266945, 0.06693483144044876, 0.043133750557899475, 0.005955968517810106, -0.0027471547946333885, 0.026240458711981773, 0.007671515457332134, 0.032692283391952515, 0.006987576372