211	High-Protein Vegetarian Continental Stir-Fry	A delicious high-protein vegetarian stir-fry, ideal for muscle gain, featuring tofu and a mix of colorful vegetables with a soy-ginger sauce.	["muscle_gain"]	["muscle_gain", "high_protein", "quick", "meal_prep_friendly"]	["high-protein", "vegetarian"]	["lunch", "dinner", "snack", "breakfast"]	["Cook the brown rice according to package instructions, boiling it in ample water until tender. This should take about 25 minutes. Once cooked, drain the excess water and set aside.", "While the rice is cooking, heat 13.5g of olive oil in a large pan over medium heat.", "Add the cubed tofu to the pan and stir-fry for 5-7 minutes until golden brown. Remove the tofu from the pan and set aside.", "In the same pan, add another 13.5g of olive oil and stir-fry the minced garlic and ginger for about 30 seconds until fragrant.", "Add the sliced red bell pepper, broccoli florets, and sliced carrot. Stir-fry the vegetables for about 5-7 minutes until they are just tender but still crisp.", "Return the tofu to the pan with the vegetables. Pour in the soy sauce and toss everything to coat evenly. Cook for another 2-3 minutes.", "Serve the stir-fry over the cooked brown rice and sprinkle with toasted sesame seeds."]	continental	40	0	easy	1	{"calories": 864.0, "protein_g": 65.0, "carbs_g": 102.0, "fat_g": 24.0, "fiber_g": 12.0}	\N	\N	[-0.03942312300205231, -0.060234032571315765, 0.005682094022631645, -0.008162017911672592, -0.05013537034392357, -0.03842603787779808, -0.03246910870075226, 0.055580977350473404, 0.03300599753856659, -0.016387950628995895, 0.038809534162282944, -0.0087436493486166, 0.05578550696372986, 0.02771379053592682, -0.012086433358490467, -0.010322364047169685, -0.021846340969204903, 0.021322233602404594, -0.03492346778512001, 0.029810220003128052, 0.018113672733306885, -0.027279164642095566, 0.04793667420744896, 0.050416599959135056, 0.0007186506409198046, 0.020772559568285942, 0.03563931956887245, 0.027202464640140533, 0