212	Asian Grilled Chicken with Brown Rice and Stir-Fried Vegetables	A high-protein Asian-inspired meal featuring grilled chicken, brown rice, and stir-fried vegetables, perfect for muscle gain.	["muscle_gain"]	["high_protein", "muscle_gain", "asian", "grilled", "stir_fry"]	["high-protein"]	["lunch", "dinner", "snack", "breakfast"]	["Marinate the chicken breast with 10 grams of soy sauce, 5 grams of minced ginger, and 5 grams of minced garlic. Let it sit for at least 15 minutes.", "Cook the brown rice according to the package instructions. Use 150 grams of dry brown rice, which will yield approximately 450 grams once cooked.", "While the rice is cooking, heat a grill pan over medium-high heat and grill the marinated chicken breast until fully cooked, about 6-7 minutes per side. Let it rest for a few minutes before slicing.", "In a wok or large frying pan, heat 13.5 grams of sesame oil over medium heat. Add the remaining ginger and garlic and stir-fry for 1 minute.", "Add the broccoli and carrots to the pan and continue to stir-fry for about 5-7 minutes, until vegetables are tender but still crisp.", "Add the remaining soy sauce and sliced green onions to the vegetables and stir well to combine.", "Serve the sliced grilled chicken over a bed of cooked brown rice, topped with stir-fried vegetables. Garnish with toasted sesame seeds."]	asian	45	0	medium	1	{"calories": 872.0, "protein_g": 66.0, "carbs_g": 98.0, "fat_g": 25.0, "fiber_g": 8.0}	\N	\N	[-0.048614274710416794, -0.027363121509552002, -0.01706928014755249, 0.0007357231806963682, -0.010535103268921375, -0.04700586199760437, 0.023523036390542984, 0.03886327147483826, -0.020567577332258224, -0.01305830106139183, 0.017119543626904488, -0.04547787085175514, 0.04913701117038727, 0.02064799889922142, -0.02505102939903736, -0.012706460431218147, -0.02782553993165493, 0.04994121566414833, -0.006433650851249695, -0.005403261631727219, 0.0315650999546051, -0.03335446119308472, 0.020125264301896095, 0.027765225619077682, -0