213	Vegetarian Mexican Burrito Bowl	A high-protein, vegetarian Mexican burrito bowl packed with flavors and nutrients, perfect for muscle gain.	["muscle_gain"]	["fitness", "muscle_gain", "high_protein", "meal_prep_friendly"]	["vegetarian", "high-protein"]	["lunch", "dinner", "snack", "breakfast"]	["Cook quinoa: Rinse 120g of quinoa and cook it in 240g of water until fully absorbed and fluffy. This usually takes around 15 minutes.", "Prepare black beans: Drain and rinse 150g of canned black beans. If using dry beans, cook them until soft.", "Prepare toppings: Slice 100g avocado, halve 100g cherry tomatoes, dice 50g red onion, slice 10g jalapeno, and cut 50g of corn kernels if using fresh corn.", "Heat olive oil: In a pan, heat 13.5g olive oil over medium heat and saut\\u00e9 the red onions until translucent, about 5 minutes.", "Combine ingredients: In a large bowl, combine the cooked quinoa, black beans, saut\\u00e9ed onions, corn, cherry tomatoes, and shredded cheddar cheese (60g).", "Add flavor: Squeeze the juice of one lime (50g) into the mixture, add 10g chopped cilantro, and season with 5g salt and 2g black pepper.", "Serve: Top the bowl with sliced avocado and jalapenos. Garnish with additional cilantro if desired."]	mexican	45	0	medium	1	{"calories": 885.0, "protein_g": 66.8, "carbs_g": 98.5, "fat_g": 25.0, "fiber_g": 22.0}	\N	\N	[-0.023163016885519028, -0.02281544730067253, 0.008813366293907166, 0.02293957956135273, -0.02308853715658188, -0.05134096369147301, 0.04605294391512871, 0.054667700082063675, -0.01191666442900896, -0.0032336367294192314, 0.02795450948178768, 0.03028818964958191, 0.009911933913826942, 0.026589058339595795, -0.009254034608602524, 0.038902945816516876, -0.0032584629952907562, -0.010309156030416489, -0.04493575543165207, 0.07403227686882019, 0.039027076214551926, 0.015330292284488678, 0.0028115881141275167, 0.05427047610282898, 0.028550343587994576, 0.02817794680595398, -0.014982723630964756, -0.011190492659807205, -0.004344617482274771,